{"c":[{"id":"fea602b5005e86e1","sum":"shim _alive is dead only on ENOENT/ENOTDIR/ELOOP. EACCES/ESTALE stay alive, so rectify leaves it. Path.is_file raises before 3.14 and returns False from 3.14. Claude-only fixes must not question Cursor users. sr-initialize asks only in Claude Code; Cursor uses CURSOR_PLUGIN_ROOT.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261016T215531Z-cabd5aa56838fc34","text":"shim _alive: only ENOENT/ENOTDIR/ELOOP mean a baked engine is dead; other stat errors (EACCES, ESTALE) count as alive, so rectify leaves it. Do not use Path.is_file: it raises those before Python 3.14 and returns False from 3.14.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T222048Z-5c4cd091dd70b15f","text":"Design rule (operator, 2026-10-16): fixes for Claude Code-only problems must not add questions for Cursor users. sr-initialize asks the user only in Claude Code; Cursor keeps its own evidence (CURSOR_PLUGIN_ROOT).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"dc126cfe9aa69545","sum":"installed_plugins.json beside cache/ lists only the cache copy, never the checkout (dir-marketplace too). --plugin-dir and synced copies: none; orphans keep version-dir plus .orphaned_at. Cursor: no record. CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR and CLAUDE_CODE_PLUGIN_CACHE_DIR move the plugins root.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261016T223043Z-086a0d75fd95fd94","text":"Claude Code proves an install by its record, not its folder: installed_plugins.json in the plugins root (beside cache/) lists each installPath; --plugin-dir (@inline) and synced copies have none; orphans keep a version-named folder plus .orphaned_at. Cursor has no such record.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261017T010120Z-43ea3096fec682fc","text":"Claude Code copies even directory-marketplace plugins (source ./ too) into <plugins root>/cache/<mkt>/<plugin>/<version>; installed_plugins.json there records only that copy, never the checkout. CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR and CLAUDE_CODE_PLUGIN_CACHE_DIR both move the plugins root.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
